//   target/release/reify: check/eval EXIT 0, `W.v = "ok"` (right value, wrong
//                         static cell type; the release profile never checks).
// This file still fails after δ alone: the subject becomes
// `Applied{Result,[Length, <placeholder E>]}`, the Err binder `e` is typed with
// that placeholder, and the match's result type is the FIRST arm's body type,
// so `v` is typed by the placeholder — which `is_representable_cell_type`
// (crates/reify-eval/src/engine_eval.rs) rejects. Only R5 (pick the first
// arm whose type carries no placeholder) closes it.
